---
layout: base.njk
title: "Clients & Testimonials | VidhiCorp Legal Chambers"
description: "Select clientele and client testimonials for VidhiCorp Legal Chambers, spanning real estate, manufacturing, retail and cross-border businesses advised by Jankee Ballabh Pandey."
permalink: /clients/
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497215728101-856f4ea42174?w=1920&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" loading="eager"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Clients</p>
    <h1>Clients &amp; testimonials.</h1>
    <p>Businesses the chambers advises on an ongoing basis, and what their leadership and general counsel say about working with us.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Select clientele</p>
        <h2>Businesses we advise.</h2>
        <p>A sample of the developers, manufacturers and consumer businesses the chambers has represented on an ongoing basis.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="client-grid reveal-stagger">
      {% for c in clients %}
      <div class="client-card">
        {% if c.logo %}<img src="{{ c.logo }}" alt="{{ c.name }} logo" style="max-height:40px;max-width:160px;margin-bottom:14px;display:block">{% else %}<span class="pill">{{ c.sector }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ c.desc }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stat-band bg-alt">
  <div class="container" style="display:contents">
    <div class="stat-item"><b data-count="2000" data-suffix="+">0</b><span>Commercial contracts &amp; transactions handled</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><b data-count="800" data-suffix="+">0</b><span>Litigation, M&amp;A &amp; compliance matters</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><b>₹1,200+ Cr</b><span>Disputes &amp; arbitration handled</span></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><b data-count="20" data-suffix="+">0</b><span>Years, multi-jurisdictional experience</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">In their words</p>
        <h2>What clients and peers say.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial-grid reveal-stagger">
      {% for t in testimonials %}
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <blockquote>&ldquo;{{ t.quote }}&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <div class="quote-attr"><span class="bar"></span><div><b>{{ t.name }}</b>{% if t.designation %}<span>{{ t.designation }}</span>{% endif %}</div></div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band grain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Considering the chambers?</p>
    <h2>Speak to us about your matter, the way these clients did before you.</h2>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss Your Matter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
